# MS-V licensing (dual structure)

This repository uses a **two-tier** license model: **Concept Evaluation License (CEL)**
for public access, and **Prime Collaboration Agreement (PCA)** terms for development
and production.

| Tier | Document | Who |
|------|----------|-----|
| **Public — evaluation only** | CEL below | Qualified reviewers — read, internal trade study, capture |
| **Prime / Program** | [LICENSE-COMMERCIAL.md](LICENSE-COMMERCIAL.md) | U.S. primes, fill vendors, integrators under signed PCA |

**Partnership guide:** [docs/licensing-and-partnership.md](docs/licensing-and-partnership.md)  
**Inquiry:** [Partnership issue template](https://github.com/Fratres-X-AI/MS-V/issues/new?template=partnership_inquiry.yml)

---

## Concept Evaluation License (CEL)

**Version 1.0 · May 2026**  
**Copyright (c) 2026 Fratres-X-AI. All rights reserved.**

SPDX-License-Identifier: LicenseRef-MS-V-CEL-1.0

By accessing, cloning, downloading, or using this repository (the **Materials**),
you agree to the terms below. If you do not agree, do not use the Materials.

### 1. Definitions

| Term | Meaning |
|------|---------|
| **Materials** | All content in this repository: documentation, source code, data, models, figures, RTM, and concept art. |
| **Evaluation Use** | Non-commercial internal review for trade studies, capture, architecture assessment, academic reference, or partnership diligence. |
| **Commercial Use** | Any use intended for or directed toward monetary compensation, product sale, manufacturing, government deliverable, or competitive offering. |
| **Production** | Manufacture, assembly, fill, packaging, or delivery of munitions, obscurants, or related articles derived from the Materials. |

### 2. Grant (evaluation only)

Subject to this CEL, Fratres-X-AI grants you a **limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable,
revocable** license to:

- Access and read the Materials  
- Copy the Materials **only** for Evaluation Use within your organization  
- Reference the Materials in internal briefings with appropriate **not validation** disclaimers  
- Fork the repository **only** for private Evaluation Use (not public redistribution of derivatives)

### 3. Restrictions

You **may not**, without a signed [LICENSE-COMMERCIAL.md](LICENSE-COMMERCIAL.md) PCA or
separate written agreement from Fratres-X-AI:

- Use the Materials for **Commercial Use** or **Production**  
- Manufacture, field, export, or procure any munition or obscurant system based on the Materials  
- Sublicense, sell, or publicly distribute modified versions of the Materials  
- Remove copyright, license, or program notices  
- Use **MS-V**, **Veil**, or associated branding as your product name or imply endorsement  
- Represent M&S outputs as field-tested, validated, or procurement-ready  
- Upload export-controlled or classified data into public forks or issues  

### 4. No patent or trademark license

This CEL grants **no** patent, trademark, or trade-dress rights. All Background IP
remains the property of Fratres-X-AI unless assigned in a PCA.

### 5. Contributions

Contributions to this repository are governed by [CONTRIBUTING.md](CONTRIBUTING.md).
By contributing, you grant Fratres-X-AI the rights needed to include your contribution
under this CEL and applicable PCA terms.

### 6. Development and production

Any **development**, **prototype**, **bench test**, **range test**, or **production**
requires a signed **Prime Collaboration Agreement** under
[LICENSE-COMMERCIAL.md](LICENSE-COMMERCIAL.md).

### 7. Export control

Materials are **unclassified and notional**. You are responsible for compliance with
U.S. export control and sanctions laws (e.g. ITAR/EAR). Nothing here authorizes export
or foreign disclosure of controlled technical data.

### 8. Disclaimer

THE MATERIALS ARE PROVIDED **“AS IS”** FOR ENGINEERING EVALUATION ONLY. ALL PERFORMANCE
FIGURES ARE **LITERATURE-PARAMETER M&S** UNLESS AND UNTIL VALIDATED BY TEST.
FRATRES-X-AI DISCLAIMS ALL WARRANTIES. USE AT YOUR OWN RISK.

### 9. Termination

This license **terminates automatically** if you breach any term. Upon termination,
you must cease use and destroy copies except as required by law or PCA.

### 10. Governing law

This CEL is governed by the laws of the State of Delaware, U.S.A., without regard to
conflict-of-law rules. Disputes shall be resolved in courts of competent jurisdiction
in Delaware unless a PCA specifies otherwise.

