## MS-V program notice

This repository contains the **MS-V Veil (Multispectral Obscurant Grenade)** concept —
documentation, Monte Carlo models, and concept art for a **TRL 2 sensitivity study**.

- All specifications and M&S outputs are **notional** unless validated by partner test.  
- Content is **not** authorization to procure, manufacture, export, field, or employ any system.  
- Concept art is **illustrative** — not build drawings or AMCCOM-approved marking packages.  

For prime teaming or production licensing: [Licensing & partnership](docs/licensing-and-partnership.md).

*This license is for discussion and repository governance. It is not legal advice.
Consult counsel before relying on enforceability.*
